    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oryks is a 2D platform game inspired by the Halloween atmosphere like in Tim Burton's films.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, commissioned by the mysterious cult &quot;Oryks&quot;, must investigate paranormal activity in a certain town </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and its surroundings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966580/extras/09dd315a9a7719065bc89e1e2a1dd15f.poster.avif?t=1732657273\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966580/extras/09dd315a9a7719065bc89e1e2a1dd15f.webm?t=1732657273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966580/extras/09dd315a9a7719065bc89e1e2a1dd15f.mp4?t=1732657273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct investigations and fight various dark creatures, from ghosts to vampires, using various weapons and methods to defeat them, all in the atmosphere of an autumn Halloween evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966580/extras/6a6e082ecfeafae9d2d5399d6df5e4c5.poster.avif?t=1732657273\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966580/extras/6a6e082ecfeafae9d2d5399d6df5e4c5.webm?t=1732657273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966580/extras/6a6e082ecfeafae9d2d5399d6df5e4c5.mp4?t=1732657273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\